WEBVTT

00:00.490 --> 00:03.190
<b>Royal Capital  Secondary 
Estate of Duke Kadlecek</b>

00:00.870 --> 00:03.190
You have my thanks for coming here.

00:03.190 --> 00:06.520
It's a pleasure to see 
you again, Lord Morteln.

00:03.710 --> 00:06.520
<b>Leader of the Royal Capital's 
Central Army  Duke Kadlecek</b>

00:06.520 --> 00:09.380
The feeling is most mutual, Your Grace.

00:11.210 --> 00:15.450
Congratulations on your 
eldest's heir coming of age.

00:15.450 --> 00:20.200
Well... he may have grown, 
but he's just a child.

00:20.440 --> 00:24.700
It's an honor to be invited to a banquet

00:24.700 --> 00:26.420
held by the leader of the central army.

00:28.410 --> 00:32.120
It's flattering to hear that 
from a hero of your stature!

00:32.540 --> 00:34.630
This is my grandson, Squale.

00:34.850 --> 00:37.840
He graduated first in his class 
at the officers' boarding school.

00:35.360 --> 00:38.600
<b>Squale</b>

00:38.600 --> 00:40.680
That's magnificent!

00:40.680 --> 00:44.890
I-It's an honor to meet you, my lord!

00:45.130 --> 00:48.020
It's a true pleasure to 
meet you, Lord Squale.

00:48.430 --> 00:51.140
As your are my superior in rank,

00:51.480 --> 00:53.860
I would entreat you to call me "Casserole."

00:53.860 --> 00:56.070
F-Forgive my error!

00:56.070 --> 00:58.690
Unclench already, boy.

00:58.690 --> 01:01.000
Forgive him, Lord Morteln.

01:01.000 --> 01:06.290
He's told me how he idolizes you, and he's
 been looking forward meeting you.

01:06.710 --> 01:14.010
It appears the minstrels have made tales 
of your exploits popular among the youth.

01:14.550 --> 01:16.470
I can think of no greater honor.

01:17.210 --> 01:20.260
And this would be... your son?

01:20.260 --> 01:21.210
Yes.

01:21.210 --> 01:23.130
Pas, introduce yourself.

01:27.010 --> 01:28.980
I am truly honored to make your acquaintance.

01:29.410 --> 01:33.820
I am the son of Casserole 
Mille Morteln, Pastry.

01:40.260 --> 01:45.290
<i>This is the tale of a genius patissier 
who died before his time,</i>

01:45.290 --> 01:49.540
<i>and was reincarnated as the son 
of a poor noble in another world</i>

01:49.540 --> 01:52.680
<i>to pursue a world full 
of desserts and smiles.</i>

01:53.550 --> 01:58.280
<i>It's a tale that is at once cold 
and unsparing, and syrupy sweet.</i>

01:59.690 --> 02:06.110
<i>His dream is to create this 
world's very own land of sweets!</i>

02:14.070 --> 02:16.650
<b>Sweet Reincarnation</b>

03:38.560 --> 03:39.890
Lord Squale,

03:39.000 --> 03:43.950
<b>Sweet Matchmaking Photos and Twin Ladies</b>

03:39.890 --> 03:43.570
my most heartfelt congratulations on 
your recent ascension to manhood.

03:44.310 --> 03:47.910
Your granting of this auspicious 
audience has been a true honor for me.

03:47.910 --> 03:49.870
Huh? Oh, r-right!

03:50.270 --> 03:53.790
Your elegant words f-flatter—
m-my most unwor—

03:53.790 --> 03:54.580
Ow.

03:55.830 --> 03:57.540
Magnificent!

03:57.540 --> 04:00.320
You're more put-together 
than my own grandson!

04:00.320 --> 04:04.790
I heard you've come of 
age as well, Lord Pastry.

04:05.120 --> 04:07.260
Were you endowed with magic at that time?

04:07.260 --> 04:07.990
Yes.

04:08.390 --> 04:13.480
By the grace of God, I was 
blessed with the use of magic.

04:15.080 --> 04:17.480
For both father and son to be so gifted...

04:17.480 --> 04:21.780
Truly, House Morteln must 
have earned God's favor.

04:22.130 --> 04:24.720
As wonderful as the thought might be,

04:24.720 --> 04:26.990
it may be no more than coincidence.

04:28.740 --> 04:32.660
I believe luck was with me, nothing more.

04:34.620 --> 04:39.210
Would you be so kind as 
to demonstrate your magic?

04:39.800 --> 04:41.920
If Your Grace so wishes it.

04:42.180 --> 04:46.140
Might I ask you to hold out that cloth, then?

04:46.140 --> 04:47.720
Yes, most certainly!

04:56.140 --> 04:56.990
<i>Replicate!</i>

05:04.490 --> 05:06.950
This is magnificent!

05:07.330 --> 05:10.080
I see. A spell that lets 
you create pictures...

05:10.080 --> 05:12.070
It's truly spectacular!

05:12.070 --> 05:13.660
I thank you, Your Grace.

05:15.000 --> 05:19.710
If I may, I wish to offer it as 
a gift to Lord Squale Kadlecek.

05:21.000 --> 05:25.260
On behalf of myself and Margrave Hubarek.

05:25.480 --> 05:27.810
Margrave Hubarek?

05:27.810 --> 05:30.380
He doesn't appear to be 
in attendance today.

05:30.720 --> 05:33.220
Could it be... that this girl is...?

05:33.220 --> 05:34.040
Indeed.

05:34.480 --> 05:36.670
Third daughter of Margrave Hubarek,

05:36.670 --> 05:38.690
the lady Petra.

05:39.210 --> 05:40.750
Prior to our arrival here,

05:40.750 --> 05:44.400
my father used his magic to 
visit the Margravate of Hubarek,

05:44.400 --> 05:46.150
whereupon we met with them.

05:46.150 --> 05:51.830
As you know, the margravate is 
constantly feuding with its neighbor.

05:52.130 --> 05:55.540
As this creates challenges for Lady 
Petra in leaving their territory,

05:55.540 --> 05:59.120
the margrave asked if we might 
introduce her on his behalf.

06:00.120 --> 06:02.490
This is Lady Petra?

06:03.100 --> 06:05.130
She's so charming!

06:07.280 --> 06:08.630
Next month,

06:08.630 --> 06:11.140
Lady Petra will be holding a celebration 
for her own imminent coming of age.

06:12.050 --> 06:16.770
She had hoped to have Lord Squale in 
attendance as an expression of friendship.

06:17.030 --> 06:18.100
I'm afraid we—

06:18.100 --> 06:19.730
I'd love to!

06:19.970 --> 06:21.810
<i>My fool of a grandson!</i>

06:22.240 --> 06:25.400
<i>Responding so quickly without 
considering his station!</i>

06:25.800 --> 06:28.860
<i>Can't he see they're trying 
to arrange a marriage?</i>

06:29.430 --> 06:31.070
<i>This boy...</i>

06:31.340 --> 06:34.540
<i>I can't underestimate him 
just because he's a child.</i>

06:34.810 --> 06:37.000
What day next month will it be?

06:37.000 --> 06:38.960
Calm yourself, Squale.

06:39.520 --> 06:42.170
How do you intend to travel there?

06:43.930 --> 06:46.460
There's no need to worry 
about that, Your Grace.

06:46.460 --> 06:47.420
What?

06:47.690 --> 06:50.630
My father would be more 
than willing to assist.

06:50.930 --> 06:53.180
That's right, Grandfather!

06:53.180 --> 06:58.250
With the use of Lord Morteln's magic,
 I'd easily be able to attend!

07:00.390 --> 07:03.770
Lord Morteln! May I truly 
ask this imposition of you?

07:03.770 --> 07:05.610
It's no trouble at all.

07:06.610 --> 07:08.820
Heaven's sake...

07:08.820 --> 07:09.750
Your Grace.

07:12.850 --> 07:14.990
At the time of our visit,

07:14.990 --> 07:17.990
it appeared to me that Lord 
Hubarek had ulterior motives.

07:17.990 --> 07:19.460
Ulterior motives?

07:19.680 --> 07:25.350
I believe he's grown weary 
of the constant border feuds.

07:26.330 --> 07:27.920
How is that relevant?

07:31.010 --> 07:34.110
I believe he'd like to use the awesome 
military power Your Grace controls

07:34.110 --> 07:36.460
to diminish his opponent's will to fight

07:36.460 --> 07:39.060
and end the feuding forever.

07:41.210 --> 07:45.470
I believe he may be seeking 
a match for that purpose.

07:47.620 --> 07:49.070
I see.

07:50.340 --> 07:53.240
I'll bear that in mind. Thank you.

07:53.750 --> 07:56.350
All merely my own speculation, of course.

07:57.560 --> 08:02.920
Out of respect for his invitation, 
I shall attend the festivities as well!

08:03.150 --> 08:06.130
Perhaps my son will find 
his romantic destiny,

08:06.670 --> 08:10.840
and it will surely make a good 
story to take back to His Majesty!

08:11.130 --> 08:15.050
<i>Bellowing it out like that to make
 sure those around us hear...</i>

08:15.710 --> 08:18.760
I place myself in your hands, Lord Morteln.

08:19.930 --> 08:21.730
My lord.

08:22.610 --> 08:24.510
<i>He's declared intent to 
keep the king informed</i>

08:24.510 --> 08:29.310
<i>and to act in accordance with the 
best interests of the kingdom.</i>

08:37.720 --> 08:39.730
Lord Pastry Morteln.

08:40.140 --> 08:44.410
In honor of this occasion, 
would you be willing to call me Squale?

08:45.710 --> 08:48.460
I'm a bit uncomfortable with formalities.

08:48.460 --> 08:49.970
Gladly done.

08:49.970 --> 08:53.170
Then I'll ask you to call me Pastry as well.

08:53.170 --> 08:54.630
I'll do that.

08:54.630 --> 08:56.640
By the way, Lord Pastry...

08:56.640 --> 08:57.360
Yes?

08:57.790 --> 09:01.450
What kinds of things does Lady Petra like?

09:01.810 --> 09:03.960
Flowers, for instance, 
or a particular cuisine...

09:03.960 --> 09:05.670
Things she likes?

09:05.670 --> 09:07.100
Let me see...

09:07.100 --> 09:10.110
I've only met her once, but...

09:12.330 --> 09:14.080
It appears she likes sweets.

09:14.080 --> 09:15.180
Sweets?

09:15.180 --> 09:19.160
I presented her with handmade 
cookies when we first met.

09:19.820 --> 09:23.620
Are you skilled at making 
sweets, Lord Pastry?

09:23.620 --> 09:25.670
I most certainly am!

09:26.710 --> 09:30.690
I'm never happier than 
when I'm making sweets!

09:31.860 --> 09:35.570
In fact, I recently made a pie with 
bonkas I'd bought here in the capital—

09:35.570 --> 09:39.240
Um... do you think we might 
discuss that another time?

09:41.590 --> 09:44.980
Oh, forgive me...

09:44.980 --> 09:47.240
So, er...

09:48.170 --> 09:51.320
I... I have a favor to 
ask of you, Lord Pastry!

09:51.690 --> 09:54.550
I'd be glad to provide any service I can.

09:54.550 --> 09:56.390
It's something that only you can do!

09:57.440 --> 09:59.270
You want me to make sweets?!

10:01.660 --> 10:04.000
Leave it all to me! We'll start with—

10:04.000 --> 10:05.770
It's about Lady Petra's portrait...

10:05.770 --> 10:06.370
What?

10:07.290 --> 10:08.820
Could you alter it, perhaps?

10:08.820 --> 10:10.080
Alter it?

10:11.270 --> 10:14.800
Could you perhaps enhance its sensuality?

10:19.750 --> 10:23.890
<i>Men are all the same... 
in any age, in any world...</i>

10:29.440 --> 10:30.490
Let's go!

10:33.140 --> 10:38.780
The provision of food and firewood 
among the citizens is going smoothly.

10:39.210 --> 10:42.740
And it's all on House Morteln's tab, right?

10:43.050 --> 10:46.370
Did you really have to do
this all yourself, boss?

10:46.370 --> 10:47.700
What do you mean by that?

10:48.020 --> 10:52.110
A lord so eager to enrich his subjects 
that he goes off to earn his own money...

10:52.110 --> 10:54.670
It's pretty unheard of.

10:54.890 --> 10:57.420
It may not be the dignified thing to do,

10:57.420 --> 11:02.510
but I'd hardly be living up to my 
responsibilities if I let my subjects starve.

11:03.200 --> 11:07.600
Well, that indulgent side of 
yours is part of your charm.

11:07.600 --> 11:12.340
I'll need you to work all the harder 
to compensate for my indulgent side.

11:12.680 --> 11:16.830
You could afford to show <i>me</i> a 
little indulgence, you know...

11:18.290 --> 11:21.430
What are we indulging in? Sweets?

11:21.780 --> 11:23.020
No.

11:23.020 --> 11:24.360
Aw, shucks.

11:26.940 --> 11:29.930
Everything's about sweets for you, huh, kid?

11:30.400 --> 11:33.100
Father, these letters came for you.

11:33.100 --> 11:34.840
Did they? Thanks.

11:35.060 --> 11:40.800
One is from Duke Kadlecek. 
The other is from Margrave Hubarek.

11:50.320 --> 11:51.640
What do they say?

11:52.220 --> 11:54.750
Rejoice, Feuille, Pas.

11:54.750 --> 11:56.860
We've got a windfall coming.

11:57.360 --> 11:59.320
It says 20,000 silver coins here.

11:59.320 --> 12:00.970
Awesome!

12:00.970 --> 12:05.280
Lord Squale's been engaged 
to Lady Petra, then?!

12:05.570 --> 12:06.310
Yes.

12:06.650 --> 12:11.830
It appears they've decided to announce it 
privately when Lady Petra comes of age.

12:12.820 --> 12:17.310
<i>It was worth spending all those 
hours on the matchmaking photo!</i>

12:17.310 --> 12:19.710
<i>After all, to get that photo...</i>

12:20.140 --> 12:25.410
<i>It took two whole days to produce 
one that the margrave approved of!</i>

12:29.430 --> 12:33.630
And he's going to send an 
advance of thirty gold coins.

12:33.630 --> 12:35.700
How very generous of him!

12:35.700 --> 12:39.440
Maybe you can build yourself 
a grand estate, boss!

12:39.440 --> 12:40.350
Don't be a fool.

12:40.350 --> 12:43.650
It's funding for Lady Petra's security.

12:44.510 --> 12:45.240
Security?

12:45.800 --> 12:48.650
He's requested that we 
keep her safe to, from,

12:48.650 --> 12:53.430
and during her coming of age 
announcement in the capital.

12:53.430 --> 12:55.250
I see.

12:55.250 --> 12:59.470
There are plenty of people out there who 
would oppose the idea of a marriage

12:59.470 --> 13:01.590
between Houses Hubarek and Kadlecek.

13:01.590 --> 13:02.560
Yes.

13:02.560 --> 13:06.300
The neighbor they're feuding
 with in particular.

13:06.570 --> 13:09.440
But they're keeping the 
engagement secret, right?

13:09.440 --> 13:11.770
As long as the information doesn't get out...

13:12.000 --> 13:13.210
It's the Church, right?

13:16.580 --> 13:20.500
Officially, the Church is a neutral entity,

13:20.500 --> 13:24.000
but a large enough bribe 
can loosen their tongues.

13:24.850 --> 13:27.230
And the fact that they're officially neutral

13:27.230 --> 13:31.040
allows them to collect a 
whole lot of information...

13:31.040 --> 13:33.870
Sheesh, what a pain in the neck!

13:33.870 --> 13:39.390
I can protect Lady Petra herself well enough 
with just my teleportation spell, but...

13:39.840 --> 13:41.440
Yes, it won't be easy.

13:41.780 --> 13:43.430
Looking after Lady Petra

13:43.430 --> 13:46.340
while also transporting her 
retinue and guards to the capital

13:46.670 --> 13:48.680
would prove difficult, even for you.

13:48.680 --> 13:53.590
And assuming I teleport just 
Lady Petra to the capital,

13:53.590 --> 13:56.280
we would need to secure guards for her there.

13:56.660 --> 13:59.300
So that's what the gold's for, right?

13:59.300 --> 14:01.870
But even if you try to 
recruit aid in the capital,

14:01.870 --> 14:05.390
there's a good chance unsavory 
elements might infiltrate your hires.

14:06.550 --> 14:08.260
Should we turn the job down?

14:08.650 --> 14:09.450
Don't be a fool.

14:09.700 --> 14:13.480
Nothing will better secure 
our position than to earn

14:13.480 --> 14:16.410
the trust of two of the 
kingdom's major players.

14:16.780 --> 14:21.880
To ensure the prosperity of the 
Fief of Morteln, I must accept.

14:22.510 --> 14:26.330
<i>Yes, and it's not just 
for the Fief of Morteln.</i>

14:27.260 --> 14:31.380
<i>To make my dream of a land 
of sweets a reality...</i>

14:31.890 --> 14:34.560
<i>we must make this mission a success.</i>

14:36.130 --> 14:40.250
<i>If not for the risk of the 
Church leaking information...</i>

14:40.850 --> 14:42.060
The Church?

14:42.060 --> 14:43.050
Kid?

14:43.050 --> 14:45.280
What's this about the Church, Pas?

14:45.550 --> 14:49.360
I just thought of a great place 
where we can keep Lady Petra safe!

14:49.360 --> 14:50.200
What?

14:50.200 --> 14:52.860
A place with no windows 
and only one entrance

14:53.210 --> 14:55.790
surrounded by thick walls...

14:56.940 --> 14:59.120
The True Sanctification ritual chamber?

14:59.350 --> 15:02.080
Of course! That's a great idea!

15:02.790 --> 15:06.850
Since she's going to the capital for 
her coming of age announcement anyway,

15:06.850 --> 15:09.730
it's natural that she'd undergo 
the Sanctification Ceremony.

15:10.460 --> 15:13.350
If we just tell people that 
it's running a bit long...

15:14.430 --> 15:18.390
So we lock Lady Petra in until 
the engagement is announced!

15:18.670 --> 15:21.430
"Lock her in" sounds a bit unsavory...

15:21.430 --> 15:24.610
We're keeping her safe from outside elements.

15:25.100 --> 15:26.410
It might just work.

15:26.410 --> 15:28.600
Right. Let's try it.

15:28.600 --> 15:29.690
Yes!

15:29.690 --> 15:34.070
And if we don't have to hire mercenaries, 
we can pocket those thirty gold coins!

15:34.070 --> 15:35.520
There's also this.

15:35.520 --> 15:39.050
A receipt for materials from 
the traveling merchant.

15:39.050 --> 15:40.290
Please see to it.

15:40.290 --> 15:41.510
I will.

15:42.250 --> 15:43.980
If you'll excuse me, then.

15:44.330 --> 15:45.670
Hold on, Pas.

15:46.940 --> 15:50.670
Wh-What is it, Fathe—

15:50.670 --> 15:56.080
What's this about a crate of 
bonkas and a barrel of sugar?

15:57.890 --> 15:59.980
The kid's making sweets again, huh?

16:00.390 --> 16:05.440
Did you spend all this 
money without telling me?

16:05.750 --> 16:06.900
Tee-hee!

16:07.210 --> 16:10.430
Don't you titter at me, you fool of a son!

16:10.170 --> 16:11.860
<b>Bonk</b>

16:12.160 --> 16:15.320
No allowance for you until I say otherwise!

16:18.550 --> 16:22.500
<b>Estate of Margrave Hubarek</b>

16:24.950 --> 16:28.460
Lord Casserole, thank you for coming.

16:28.980 --> 16:32.420
<b>Donachel Mille Hubarek</b>

16:30.990 --> 16:34.890
We're honored that you came to 
meet us in person, Lord Hubarek.

16:34.890 --> 16:37.850
And your son is with you today?

16:37.850 --> 16:39.930
Yes, as we're escorting Her Ladyship.

16:41.320 --> 16:46.440
Like it or not, she may be 
waiting for quite a long time.

16:46.770 --> 16:50.160
Having someone closer to her own age 
might keep her from getting bored.

16:50.900 --> 16:55.920
<i>I can't exactly tell him my nine-year-old 
son is in on the plan.</i>

16:56.780 --> 16:58.310
It's a pleasure to see you again.

16:58.970 --> 17:03.740
Your magic is why we were blessed 
with this marriage, Lord Pastry.

17:03.740 --> 17:04.680
I owe you my thanks.

17:04.680 --> 17:06.530
You honor me.

17:06.890 --> 17:09.000
Now, to the carriage.

17:09.000 --> 17:11.170
My daughter is already on board.

17:14.840 --> 17:16.550
Lord Morteln!

17:16.550 --> 17:19.320
Thank you for accompanying me.

17:19.800 --> 17:24.270
Lady Petra, I have never seen 
you looking more lovely.

17:24.580 --> 17:26.730
My, what a flatterer!

17:26.970 --> 17:30.190
Lady Petra, I'm glad to see you well.

17:30.510 --> 17:31.930
Lord Pastry.

17:31.930 --> 17:34.890
Thank you for the cookies 
you recently gifted me.

17:35.270 --> 17:38.550
I'm thrilled to know that you enjoyed them.

17:38.880 --> 17:41.740
I'll seek some occasion to send you more.

17:41.740 --> 17:43.100
How delightful!

17:43.100 --> 17:45.660
I've been dreaming about them ever since.

17:45.660 --> 17:47.210
They were truly delicious!

17:47.210 --> 17:50.670
When I was mixing in the 
flour, I added a little—

17:51.630 --> 17:53.070
Pas, we're in a hurry.

17:53.070 --> 17:55.030
F-Forgive me!

17:57.430 --> 17:59.970
Lady Licorice, a pleasure to see you again.

18:00.600 --> 18:01.550
Yes...

18:01.550 --> 18:04.560
Lico, try to be a bit more forthcoming.

18:04.560 --> 18:07.530
He kindly traveled all this 
way to escort us, after all.

18:08.060 --> 18:10.020
Forgive me, Sister.

18:10.460 --> 18:13.010
Don't apologize to me, now.

18:13.350 --> 18:17.040
Lord Pastry, I do hope she hasn't upset you.

18:17.040 --> 18:19.110
No, not at all.

18:22.530 --> 18:23.530
Let's move out.

18:27.500 --> 18:29.760
Can you make things other than cookies?

18:29.760 --> 18:31.210
Of course I can!

18:32.680 --> 18:36.590
I'm just... an afterthought, after all.

18:38.640 --> 18:40.230
<i>The plan today</i>

18:40.640 --> 18:43.380
<i>is to enter the church within 
the margravate's borders</i>

18:43.380 --> 18:46.600
<i>under claim of receiving 
a True Sanctification.</i>

18:47.770 --> 18:51.190
<i>From there, we'll teleport 
to the church in the capital.</i>

18:53.140 --> 18:55.560
<i>Then, in the capital,</i>

18:55.560 --> 18:58.060
<i>Lady Petra enters the chamber 
until announcement time,</i>

18:58.610 --> 19:00.300
<i>while we all stand guard.</i>

19:00.300 --> 19:01.570
<i>That's the basic idea.</i>

19:02.490 --> 19:06.680
It's true! And every bonka is unique...

19:04.970 --> 19:10.500
As expected, those seeking to harm 
my daughter are making their move.

19:06.940 --> 19:08.050


19:08.050 --> 19:08.670


19:08.670 --> 19:10.500


19:10.500 --> 19:13.900
I'm counting on you, Lord Casserole.

19:10.500 --> 19:14.610


19:14.610 --> 19:16.040


19:15.120 --> 19:19.300
My men are already making 
preparations in the capital.

19:16.040 --> 19:17.390


19:17.390 --> 19:20.000


19:20.000 --> 19:22.930
I swear, I will protect your daughter.

19:20.320 --> 19:22.360


19:22.360 --> 19:22.930


19:39.990 --> 19:42.700
Now, milady, we've arrived.

19:42.700 --> 19:43.660
Right.

20:06.490 --> 20:07.010
<i>They're coming!</i>

20:13.600 --> 20:14.900
They're inside the carriage!

20:16.540 --> 20:17.270
No!

20:19.500 --> 20:20.690
My ladies!

20:28.170 --> 20:30.200
Y-You brat...

20:30.200 --> 20:33.540
I won't let you lay a hand upon these girls!

20:40.260 --> 20:41.530
Look ou—

20:48.780 --> 20:49.810
Fools!

20:49.810 --> 20:52.060
Train two hundred years more, then try again!

20:52.400 --> 20:53.660
Retreat!

20:58.010 --> 21:02.690
Father... I don't think people 
can live for two hundred years.

21:03.710 --> 21:06.490
I'll reduce it to one hundred, then.

21:06.490 --> 21:08.500
I don't think that'll work either...

21:08.500 --> 21:11.390
Lord Casserole, Lord Pastry...

21:11.390 --> 21:12.600
Magnificent work.

21:12.600 --> 21:16.040
I'm grateful to you for 
protecting my daughters.

21:16.040 --> 21:16.800
It's nothing.

21:16.800 --> 21:18.580
Now, let's hurry inside.

21:22.970 --> 21:24.790
Come, let's go.

21:24.790 --> 21:25.680
Right...

21:29.750 --> 21:31.430
<i>Understandable, I suppose.</i>

21:39.750 --> 21:41.870
It's my first time in the basement here.

21:42.530 --> 21:44.660
We're going quite far down, aren't we?

21:45.820 --> 21:47.970
S-Sister...

21:54.200 --> 21:55.830
You'll be safe.

21:56.330 --> 21:58.170
We're with you.

23:37.150 --> 23:39.070
Next time on <i>Sweet Reincarnation</i>...

23:39.120 --> 23:44.980
<b>Schemes and Frothy Hearts</b>

23:39.380 --> 23:41.310
"Schemes and Frothy Hearts."

23:41.660 --> 23:42.980
Bon appétit!

23:44.980 --> 23:50.250
<b>Illustration:</b>

23:44.980 --> 23:50.250
<b>Enishi Shiobe</b>
